{%- comment -%}
  WANELO ICON — single source of truth for category line-icons.

  Usage:
    {% render 'wanelo-icon', icon: 'foot-care' %}

  Design: thin-stroke Lucide/Feather aesthetic. 24x24 viewBox, currentColor
  stroke, NO fills (site is LIGHT), stroke-width 1.7, rounded caps/joins.
  Color is controlled by the caller via CSS `color` on a wrapper. Falls back
  to a soft generic "tag" glyph when the key is unknown or blank.

  Keys are the values written to collection.metafields.custom.icon by
  pipeline/tools/assign_collection_icons.py. Legacy short keys (eye, drop,
  sparkle, shield, sun, leaf, wave, home, heart, star, lips, lipstick,
  palette) are preserved so wanelo-collection-grid.liquid keeps working.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign ic = icon | default: 'generic' | downcase | strip
  if ic == blank
    assign ic = 'generic'
  endif
-%}
<svg class="wanelo-icon__svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
